{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MuTris \u2013 30-Minute Demo Edition</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a taste of <i>MuTris</i>, the puzzle game that evolves the classic block stacking formula! In this 3 minute demo, you'll get a glimpse of the game's innovative mutation mechanics and high speed strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Gameplay</strong><br>Blocks mutate in real time changing shape, color, and size, or even splitting creating constantly shifting puzzles that demand quick thinking and adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Special Blocks</strong><br>Trigger explosive clears with bomb blocks, zap lines with lightning blocks, and wipe colors with rainbow blocks to set off satisfying chain reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Snapshot of Visual Variety</strong><br>Try out the first few levels featuring vibrant shifting color palettes and sleek animations. Choose between two distinct visual themes: cyber or terminal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive Controls</strong><br>Play with gamepad or keyboard move, rotate, mutate, and switch styles with ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Scoring &amp; Combo System</strong><br>The pace ramps up fast. Score big with clever combos and see how high you can go in just 30 minutes!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3931570?t=1760349440","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931570/524bfe4286f8f711531c270faff34d6882858101/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760349440","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931570/bb24fbfd5b4540501098f272602ef13c3e698146/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760349440","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931570/bb24fbfd5b4540501098f272602ef13c3e698146/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760349440","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MuTris \u2013 30-Minute Demo Edition</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a taste of <i>MuTris</i>, the puzzle game that evolves the classic block stacking formula! In this 3 minute demo, you'll get a glimpse of the game's innovative mutation mechanics and high speed strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Gameplay</strong><br>Blocks mutate in real time changing shape, color, and size, or even splitting creating constantly shifting puzzles that demand quick thinking and adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Special Blocks</strong><br>Trigger explosive clears with bomb blocks, zap lines with lightning blocks, and wipe colors with rainbow blocks to set off satisfying chain reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Snapshot of Visual Variety</strong><br>Try out the first few levels featuring vibrant shifting color palettes and sleek animations. Choose between two distinct visual themes: cyber or terminal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive Controls</strong><br>Play with gamepad or keyboard move, rotate, mutate, and switch styles with ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Scoring &amp; Combo System</strong><br>The pace ramps up fast. Score big with clever combos and see how high you can go in just 30 minutes!</p>","developers":["Martin Edmaier"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3914150","name":"MuTris"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com